\n</div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= SECTION 5 ================= -->\r\n<div id=\"placement\" style=\"scroll-margin-top:30vh;border:1px solid #e6e6e6;padding:20px;border-radius:1rem;margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\n<h2>Placement Opportunities in Chennai Colleges</h2>\r\n\r\n<h4>Placement Features</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Campus recruitment drives</li>\r\n<li>Internship opportunities</li>\r\n<li>Industry tie-ups</li>\r\n<li>Skill development programs</li>\r\n<li>Resume workshops</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h4>Top Recruiters</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>TCS</li>\r\n<li>Infosys</li>\r\n<li>Wipro</li>\r\n<li>Accenture</li>\r\n<li>Cognizant</li>\r\n<li>HCL</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h4>Average Packages</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Engineering: ₹4–15 LPA</li>\r\n<li>MBA: ₹5–18 LPA</li>\r\n<li>Degree courses: ₹3–7 LPA</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= SECTION 6 ================= -->\r\n<div id=\"mistakes\" style=\"scroll-margin-top:30vh;border:1px solid #e6e6e6;padding:20px;border-radius:1rem;margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\n<h2>Common Mistakes to Avoid</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Not comparing top colleges in Chennai</li>\r\n<li>Ignoring Chennai colleges fees</li>\r\n<li>Not checking placement record</li>\r\n<li>Not reviewing admission process</li>\r\n<li>Ignoring ranking and accreditation</li>\r\n<li>Choosing without checking specialization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ================= FAQs ================= -->\r\n<div id=\"faq\" style=\"scroll-margin-top:30vh;border:1px solid #e6e6e6;padding:20px;border-radius:1rem;margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\n<h2>FAQs</h2>\r\n\r\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #e6e6e6;padding:15px;border-radius:1rem;margin-top:15px;\">\r\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;\">Which are the best colleges in Chennai?</summary>\r\n<p>Some of the best colleges in Chennai include IIT Madras, Anna University, SRM Institute Chennai, Loyola College, and Madras Medical College. These top colleges in Chennai offer engineering, management, and medical programs with strong infrastructure and placement opportunities.</p>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #e6e6e6;padding:15px;border-radius:1rem;margin-top:15px;\">\r\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;\">What courses are available in colleges in Chennai?</summary>\r\n<p>Best colleges in Chennai offer BTech, MBA, MBBS, BBA, BCom, BA, and BSc programs. Universities in Chennai also provide postgraduate programs like MTech, MSc, MBA, and MD.</p>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #e6e6e6;padding:15px;border-radius:1rem;margin-top:15px;\">\r\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;\">What is the fee structure of colleges in Chennai?</summary>\r\n<p>Chennai colleges fees vary depending on course and institution. Government colleges charge ₹20,000 to ₹1 lakh annually, while private institutions charge ₹1 lakh to ₹4 lakh.</p>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #e6e6e6;padding:15px;border-radius:1rem;margin-top:15px;\">\r\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;\">How to get admission in colleges in Chennai?</summary>\r\n<p>Colleges in Chennai admission is based on merit or entrance exams. Engineering colleges Chennai accept JEE Main or TNEA, while MBA colleges Chennai accept CAT, MAT, or TANCET scores.</p>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #e6e6e6;padding:15px;border-radius:1rem;margin-top:15px;\">\r\n<summary style=\"cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;\">Do colleges in Chennai provide placements?</summary>\r\n<p>Yes, most best colleges in Chennai provide placement support including internships, training sessions, and campus recruitment drives.</p>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #e6e6e6;padding:clamp(14px,3vw,20px);border-radius:1rem;margin-bottom:40px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"margin-top:0;font-size:clamp(18px,3vw,22px);\">\r\nExplore More\r\n</h3>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:12px;\">\r\n\r\n<a hr