879;\\\">Program Fee Total ₹80,000</span>\\n          <span style=\\\"display:inline-block;background:#fdf0f2;color:#9B1C2E;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:20px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border:1px solid #f3d9dd;\\\">Total (Reg. + Program) ₹80,500</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;\\\">\\n          <a href=\\\"#\\\" style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;background:#9B1C2E;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:9px;\\\">View Course</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"#\\\" style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#9B1C2E;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;background:#ffffff;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid #f3d9dd;\\\">Fee Details</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <h4 style=\\\"margin-top:20px;\\\">Program Electives</h4>\\n    <ul style=\\\"padding-left:22px !important;line-height:1.7;word-spacing:normal;list-style-type:disc !important;list-style-position:outside !important;margin-left:0 !important;\\\">\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\"><b>MBA Electives:</b> Finance Management, Marketing, HRM, Analytics &amp; Data Science, IT &amp; FinTech, Operations Management, International Business, Information System Management, Project Management, Supply Chain Management, Banking Financial Services &amp; Insurance, Digital Marketing, Retail Management</li>\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\"><b>BBA Electives:</b> Human Resource Management, Marketing, Finance &amp; Accounting, Entrepreneurship Management &amp; Family Business, Data Analytics, Retail and E-Commerce, Digital Marketing</li>\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\"><b>BCA Electives:</b> Cloud Computing, Cyber Security, Data Science and Analytics</li>\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\"><b>MCA Electives:</b> AI and Data Science, Cloud Computing, Cyber Security</li>\\n    </ul>\\n\\n    <p style=\\\"line-height:1.7;word-spacing:normal;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\">\\n      For a complete Manipal university jaipur online muj courses fees comparison, review the Manipal Online fee structure alongside Manipal University Jaipur registration fees before selecting electives.\\n    </p>\\n\\n    <p style=\\\"line-height:1.7;word-spacing:normal;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;margin-top:18px;\\\">\\n      Note: Fees shown above under this <b>MUJ Online courses and fees</b> guide are indicative and payable per semester or per year as per the program\'s payment plan. MBA students receive a 15% discount per semester, while other courses receive a 10% discount for one semester only. A minimum fee payment of ₹5,000 secures a seat, and the one-time registration fee is ₹500. Learners across MUJ Online UG courses and MUJ Online PG courses also get access to 10,000+ Coursera courses. All programs carry a 50% eligibility criterion. Applicants comparing MUJ Online UG courses against MUJ Online PG courses should verify the latest MUJ Online program fee structure before payment. This overview of Manipal University Jaipur Online MUJ courses fees also covers Manipal University Jaipur registration fees, Manipal Online MBA fees, and Manipal Online EMI options for eligible learners across various Manipal Online programs.\\n    </p>\\n\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:20px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<!-- FAQs -->\\n<div style=\\\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid rgba(122, 31, 43, .1);border-radius:18px;margin-bottom:28px;overflow:hidden;\\\">\\n  <div style=\\\"height:5px;background:#9B1C2E;border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:20px 20px 0;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(201,146,42,0.9),rgba(217,164,65,0.8),rgba(236,200,121,0.7));backdrop-filter:blur(12px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(201,146,42,0.4),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.35);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\\\">\\n      <svg width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#ffffff\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" style=\\\"filter:drop-shadow(0 1px 3px rgba(255,255,255,0.4));\\\">\\n        <circle cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"12\\\" r=\\\"10\\\"></circle><path d=\\\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\\\"></path><line x1=\\\"12\\\" y1=\\\"17\\\" x2=\\\"12.01\\\" y2=\\\"17\\\"></line>\\n      </svg>\\n    </div>\\n    <div style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:0;\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"margin:0;font-size:clamp(15px,3vw,19px);font-weight:700;color:#241014;line-height:1.25;\\\">FAQs — MUJ Online Courses &amp; Fees</h3>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n  <div style=\\\"padding:16px 20px 24px;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:0 0 16px;\\\"></div>\\n\\n    <!-- FAQ 1 -->\\n    <div style=\\\"border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#fdf0f2;border:1px solid #f3d9dd;border-top:4px solid #9B1C2E;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(137,44,64,0.07);margin-bottom:10px;\\\" onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\';this.style.boxShadow=\'0 6px 24px rgba(137,44,64,0.13)\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.maxHeight=\'400px\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.opacity=\'1\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.paddingBottom=\'18px\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.background=\'#9B1C2E\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.color=\'#ffffff\';\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\';this.style.boxShadow=\'0 2px 8px rgba(137,44,64,0.07)\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.maxHeight=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.opacity=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.paddingBottom=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.background=\'#fdf0f2\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.color=\'#9B1C2E\';\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"padding:clamp(12px,3vw,16px) clamp(12px,3vw,20px);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(10px,2vw,14px);cursor:pointer;\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"faq-num\\\" style=\\\"flex-shrink:0;width:clamp(30px,5vw,36px);height:clamp(30px,5vw,36px);background:#fdf0f2;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:clamp(12px,2.5vw,14px);font-weight:700;color:#9B1C2E;transition:all 0.3s;\\\">1</span>\\n        <span style=\\\"font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(13px,2.5vw,15px);color:#241014;line-height:1.4;flex:1;\\\">What are the MUJ Online fees for undergraduate programs?</span>\\n        <span style=\\\"flex-shrink:0;color:#f3d9dd;font-size:clamp(16px,3vw,20px);\\\">›</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"faq-answer\\\" style=\\\"max-height:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;padding:0 clamp(12px,3vw,20px) 0 clamp(52px,10vw,70px);font-size:clamp(12px,2vw,14px);color:#241014;line-height:1.8;transition:max-height 0.4s ease,opacity 0.35s ease,padding-bottom 0.3s ease;\\\">\\n        MUJ Online BBA fees and MUJ Online BCA fees are ₹46,500 per year (₹23,250 per semester), while MUJ Online B.Com fees are ₹33,000 per year (₹16,500 per semester). These MUJ Online UG courses also carry a one-time registration fee of ₹500, in addition to the yearly academic fee.\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- FAQ 2 -->\\n    <div style=\\\"border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#fdf0f2;border:1px solid #f3d9dd;border-top:4px solid #9B1C2E;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(137,44,64,0.07);margin-bottom:10px;\\\" onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\';this.style.boxShadow=\'0 6px 24px rgba(137,44,64,0.13)\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.maxHeight=\'400px\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.opacity=\'1\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.paddingBottom=\'18px\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.background=\'#9B1C2E\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.color=\'#ffffff\';\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\';this.style.boxShadow=\'0 2px 8px rgba(137,44,64,0.07)\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.maxHeight=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.opacity=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.paddingBottom=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.background=\'#fdf0f2\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.color=\'#9B1C2E\';\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"padding:clamp(12px,3vw,16px) clamp(12px,3vw,20px);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(10px,2vw,14px);cursor:pointer;\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"faq-num\\\" style=\\\"flex-shrink:0;width:clamp(30px,5vw,36px);height:clamp(30px,5vw,36px);background:#fdf0f2;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:clamp(12px,2.5vw,14px);font-weight:700;color:#9B1C2E;transition:all 0.3s;\\\">2</span>\\n        <span style=\\\"font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(13px,2.5vw,15px);color:#241014;line-height:1.4;flex:1;\\\">What are the MUJ Online MBA fees and MUJ Online MCA fees?</span>\\n        <span style=\\\"flex-shrink:0;color:#f3d9dd;font-size:clamp(16px,3vw,20px);\\\">›</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"faq-answer\\\" style=\\\"max-height:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;padding:0 clamp(12px,3vw,20px) 0 clamp(52px,10vw,70px);font-size:clamp(12px,2vw,14px);color:#241014;line-height:1.8;transition:max-height 0.4s ease,opacity 0.35s ease,padding-bottom 0.3s ease;\\\">\\n        MUJ Online MBA fees are ₹90,000 per year (₹45,000 per semester), with a total program fee of ₹1,80,000. MUJ Online MCA fees are ₹79,000 per year (₹39,500 per semester), with a total program fee of ₹1,58,000. MBA students also receive a 15% discount per semester, while other courses receive a 10% discount for one semester only. These figures reflect the current Manipal Online MBA fees as part of the broader Manipal Online programs lineup.\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- FAQ 3 -->\\n    <div style=\\\"border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#fdf0f2;border:1px solid #f3d9dd;border-top:4px solid #9B1C2E;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(137,44,64,0.07);margin-bottom:10px;\\\" onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\';this.style.boxShadow=\'0 6px 24px rgba(137,44,64,0.13)\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.maxHeight=\'400px\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.opacity=\'1\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.paddingBottom=\'18px\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.background=\'#9B1C2E\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.color=\'#ffffff\';\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\';this.style.boxShadow=\'0 2px 8px rgba(137,44,64,0.07)\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.maxHeight=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.opacity=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.paddingBottom=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.background=\'#fdf0f2\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.color=\'#9B1C2E\';\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"padding:clamp(12px,3vw,16px) clamp(12px,3vw,20px);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(10px,2vw,14px);cursor:pointer;\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"faq-num\\\" style=\\\"flex-shrink:0;width:clamp(30px,5vw,36px);height:clamp(30px,5vw,36px);background:#fdf0f2;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:clamp(12px,2.5vw,14px);font-weight:700;color:#9B1C2E;transition:all 0.3s;\\\">3</span>\\n        <span style=\\\"font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(13px,2.5vw,15px);color:#241014;line-height:1.4;flex:1;\\\">Is the registration fee included in the total MUJ Online courses and fees?</span>\\n        <span style=\\\"flex-shrink:0;color:#f3d9dd;font-size:clamp(16px,3vw,20px);\\\">›</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"faq-answer\\\" style=\\\"max-height:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;padding:0 clamp(12px,3vw,20px) 0 clamp(52px,10vw,70px);font-size:clamp(12px,2vw,14px);color:#241014;line-height:1.8;transition:max-height 0.4s ease,opacity 0.35s ease,padding-bottom 0.3s ease;\\\">\\n        No. The ₹500 registration fee shown across every MUJ Online course card is a one-time charge separate from the yearly academic fee. Together, they make up the total Manipal University Jaipur Online fees for the full program duration. A minimum fee payment of ₹5,000 can be made to secure a seat. This is part of the standard Manipal Online fee structure and reflects the applicable Manipal University Jaipur registration fees for each program.\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- FAQ 4 -->\\n    <div style=\\\"border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#fdf0f2;border:1px solid #f3d9dd;border-top:4px solid #9B1C2E;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(137,44,64,0.07);margin-bottom:10px;\\\" onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\';this.style.boxShadow=\'0 6px 24px rgba(137,44,64,0.13)\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.maxHeight=\'400px\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.opacity=\'1\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.paddingBottom=\'18px\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.background=\'#9B1C2E\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.color=\'#ffffff\';\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\';this.style.boxShadow=\'0 2px 8px rgba(137,44,64,0.07)\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.maxHeight=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.opacity=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.paddingBottom=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.background=\'#fdf0f2\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.color=\'#9B1C2E\';\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"padding:clamp(12px,3vw,16px) clamp(12px,3vw,20px);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(10px,2vw,14px);cursor:pointer;\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"faq-num\\\" style=\\\"flex-shrink:0;width:clamp(30px,5vw,36px);height:clamp(30px,5vw,36px);background:#fdf0f2;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:clamp(12px,2.5vw,14px);font-weight:700;color:#9B1C2E;transition:all 0.3s;\\\">4</span>\\n        <span style=\\\"font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(13px,2.5vw,15px);color:#241014;line-height:1.4;flex:1;\\\">What electives can I choose in MUJ Online MBA, BBA, BCA, and MCA programs?</span>\\n        <span style=\\\"flex-shrink:0;color:#f3d9dd;font-size:clamp(16px,3vw,20px);\\\">›</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"faq-answer\\\" style=\\\"max-height:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;padding:0 clamp(12px,3vw,20px) 0 clamp(52px,10vw,70px);font-size:clamp(12px,2vw,14px);color:#241014;line-height:1.8;transition:max-height 0.4s ease,opacity 0.35s ease,padding-bottom 0.3s ease;\\\">\\n        MUJ Online MBA electives include Finance Management, Marketing, HRM, Analytics &amp; Data Science, IT &amp; FinTech, Operations Management, International Business, Information System Management, Project Management, Supply Chain Management, Banking Financial Services &amp; Insurance, Digital Marketing, and Retail Management. BBA electives include Human Resource Management, Marketing, Finance &amp; Accounting, Entrepreneurship Management &amp; Family Business, Data Analytics, Retail and E-Commerce, and Digital Marketing. BCA electives include Cloud Computing, Cyber Security, and Data Science and Analytics. MCA electives include AI and Data Science, Cloud Computing, and Cyber Security.\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- FAQ 5 -->\\n    <div style=\\\"border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#fdf0f2;border:1px solid #f3d9dd;border-top:4px solid #9B1C2E;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(137,44,64,0.07);\\\" onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\';this.style.boxShadow=\'0 6px 24px rgba(137,44,64,0.13)\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.maxHeight=\'400px\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.opacity=\'1\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.paddingBottom=\'18px\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.background=\'#9B1C2E\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.color=\'#ffffff\';\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\';this.style.boxShadow=\'0 2px 8px rgba(137,44,64,0.07)\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.maxHeight=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.opacity=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.paddingBottom=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.background=\'#fdf0f2\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.color=\'#9B1C2E\';\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"padding:clamp(12px,3vw,16px) clamp(12px,3vw,20px);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(10px,2vw,14px);cursor:pointer;\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"faq-num\\\" style=\\\"flex-shrink:0;width:clamp(30px,5vw,36px);height:clamp(30px,5vw,36px);background:#fdf0f2;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:clamp(12px,2.5vw,14px);font-weight:700;color:#9B1C2E;transition:all 0.3s;\\\">5</span>\\n        <span style=\\\"font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(13px,2.5vw,15px);color:#241014;line-height:1.4;flex:1;\\\">Are there any additional benefits included with MUJ Online fees?</span>\\n        <span style=\\\"flex-shrink:0;color:#f3d9dd;font-size:clamp(16px,3vw,20px);\\\">›</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"faq-answer\\\" style=\\\"max-height:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;padding:0 clamp(12px,3vw,20px) 0 clamp(52px,10vw,70px);font-size:clamp(12px,2vw,14px);color:#241014;line-height:1.8;transition:max-height 0.4s ease,opacity 0.35s ease,padding-bottom 0.3s ease;\\\">\\n        Yes. Learners get access to 10,000+ Coursera courses alongside their MUJ Online program. All programs carry a 50% eligibility criterion, and the MUJ Online program fees shown here are indicative and may be revised by admission cycle — applicants should verify the latest Manipal University Jaipur Online fees, along with any applicable discounts, directly before making payment. Applicants can also explore Manipal Online EMI options and review the complete Manipal university jaipur online muj courses fees breakdown before enrolling.\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:20px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\"},{\"id\":\"1789797515710\",\"title\":\"Admission Process\",\"slug\":\"admission-process\",\"content\":\"<style>\\n  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\\n  summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\\n</style>\\n\\n<h2 style=\\\"margin-bottom:20px;color:#241014;line-height:1.3;\\\">Manipal University Jaipur Online – Admission Process</h2>\\n\\n<!-- INTRODUCTION -->\\n<div style=\\\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid rgba(122, 31, 43, .1);border-radius:18px;margin-bottom:28px;overflow:hidden;\\\">\\n  <div style=\\\"height:5px;background:#9B1C2E;border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:20px 20px 0;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(155,28,46,0.9),rgba(137,44,64,0.8),rgba(201,79,92,0.7));backdrop-filter:blur(12px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(137,44,64,0.4),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.35);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\\\">\\n      <svg width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#ffffff\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" style=\\\"filter:drop-shadow(0 1px 3px rgba(255,255,255,0.4));\\\">\\n        <path d=\\\"M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M2 17l10 5 10-5\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M2 12l10 5 10-5\\\"></path>\\n      </svg>\\n    </div>\\n    <h3 style=\\\"margin:0;font-size:clamp(15px,3vw,19px);font-weight:700;color:#241014;line-height:1.25;\\\">Introduction</h3>\\n  </div>\\n  <div style=\\\"padding:16px 20px 24px;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:0 0 16px;\\\"></div>\\n    <p style=\\\"line-height:1.7;word-spacing:normal;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\">\\n      Online admission for undergraduate and postgraduate programs through Manipal University Jaipur\'s Centre for Distance &amp; Online Education (CDOE) is conducted through the university\'s online admission platform. The <b>Manipal University Jaipur Online admission</b> process allows students and working professionals to apply for degree programs such as Online BBA, Online BCA, Online B.Com, Online MBA, Online MCA, Online M.Com, Online M.Sc Mathematics, Online MA Economics and Online MA Journalism &amp; Mass Communication without visiting the campus. This overview also covers the Manipal Online admission 2026 cycle and the Manipal Online registration process for new applicants.\\n    </p>\\n    <p style=\\\"line-height:1.7;word-spacing:normal;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\">\\n      The entire <b>MUJ Online admission process</b> is conducted digitally — from registration and application to fee payment, document upload and university approval — making it convenient for students located anywhere in India to complete their <b>MUJ Online application</b> from home. Candidates begin by registering online, providing their basic and academic details, paying the applicable application/admission fee, uploading the required documents, and submitting the application for university evaluation. Every Manipal Online application also requires candidates to complete the Manipal Online registration step before proceeding to document upload.\\n    </p>\\n    <p style=\\\"line-height:1.7;word-spacing:normal;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\">\\n      Before applying, candidates are advised to check the <b>MUJ Online eligibility</b> criteria and <b>MUJ Online admission eligibility</b> requirements for their preferred program, along with the list of <b>MUJ Online documents required</b> for verification, to ensure a smooth admission experience. Program-specific eligibility varies: for example, Online BCA and BBA require 10+2/equivalent qualifications, while Online MBA and MCA have bachelor\'s-degree requirements and minimum marks criteria. Applicants should also note the Manipal University Jaipur Registration last date and applicable Manipal University Jaipur registration fees for their chosen program.\\n    </p>\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:16px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<!-- TABLE OF CONTENTS -->\\n<div style=\\\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid rgba(122, 31, 43, .1);border-radius:18px;margin-bottom:28px;overflow:hidden;\\\">\\n  <div style=\\\"height:5px;background:#9B1C2E;border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:20px 20px 0;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(155,28,46,0.9),rgba(137,44,64,0.8),rgba(201,79,92,0.7));border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(137,44,64,0.4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\\\">\\n      <svg width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#ffffff\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\">\\n        <line x1=\\\"8\\\" y1=\\\"6\\\" x2=\\\"21\\\" y2=\\\"6\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"8\\\" y1=\\\"12\\\" x2=\\\"21\\\" y2=\\\"12\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"8\\\" y1=\\\"18\\\" x2=\\\"21\\\" y2=\\\"18\\\"></line>\\n        <line x1=\\\"3\\\" y1=\\\"6\\\" x2=\\\"3.01\\\" y2=\\\"6\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"3\\\" y1=\\\"12\\\" x2=\\\"3.01\\\" y2=\\\"12\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"3\\\" y1=\\\"18\\\" x2=\\\"3.01\\\" y2=\\\"18\\\"></line>\\n      </svg>\\n    </div>\\n    <h3 style=\\\"margin:0;font-size:clamp(15px,3vw,19px);font-weight:700;color:#241014;\\\">Table of Contents</h3>\\n  </div>\\n  <div style=\\\"padding:16px 20px 24px;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:0 0 16px;\\\"></div>\\n    <div style=\\\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"#highlights\\\" style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex:1 1 260px;min-width:260px;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration:none;background:#fdf0f2;border:1px solid #f3d9dd;border-left:4px solid #9B1C2E;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;color:#0D1B2A;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;\\\">\\n        <span style=\\\"background:#9B1C2E;color:#ffffff;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;\\\">1</span>\\n        Admission Highlights 2026\\n      </a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#programs\\\" style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex:1 1 260px;min-width:260px;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration:none;background:#fdf0f2;border:1px solid #f3d9dd;border-left:4px solid #9B1C2E;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;color:#0D1B2A;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;\\\">\\n        <span style=\\\"background:#9B1C2E;color:#ffffff;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;\\\">2</span>\\n        Online Programs Offered\\n      </a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#eligibility\\\" style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex:1 1 260px;min-width:260px;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration:none;background:#fdf0f2;border:1px solid #f3d9dd;border-left:4px solid #9B1C2E;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;color:#0D1B2A;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;\\\">\\n        <span style=\\\"background:#9B1C2E;color:#ffffff;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;\\\">3</span>\\n        Eligibility &amp; Selection\\n      </a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#process\\\" style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex:1 1 260px;min-width:260px;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration:none;background:#fdf0f2;border:1px solid #f3d9dd;border-left:4px solid #9B1C2E;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;color:#0D1B2A;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;\\\">\\n        <span style=\\\"background:#9B1C2E;color:#ffffff;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;\\\">4</span>\\n        Step-by-Step Admission Process\\n      </a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#documents\\\" style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex:1 1 260px;min-width:260px;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration:none;background:#fdf0f2;border:1px solid #f3d9dd;border-left:4px solid #9B1C2E;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;color:#0D1B2A;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;\\\">\\n        <span style=\\\"background:#9B1C2E;color:#ffffff;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;\\\">5</span>\\n        Documents Required\\n      </a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#dates\\\" style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex:1 1 260px;min-width:260px;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration:none;background:#fdf0f2;border:1px solid #f3d9dd;border-left:4px solid #9B1C2E;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;color:#0D1B2A;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;\\\">\\n        <span style=\\\"background:#9B1C2E;color:#ffffff;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;\\\">6</span>\\n        Important Dates\\n      </a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#faq\\\" style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex:1 1 260px;min-width:260px;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration:none;background:#fdf0f2;border:1px solid #f3d9dd;border-left:4px solid #9B1C2E;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;color:#0D1B2A;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;\\\">\\n        <span style=\\\"background:#9B1C2E;color:#ffffff;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;\\\">7</span>\\n        FAQs\\n      </a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:16px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<!-- ADMISSION HIGHLIGHTS -->\\n<div id=\\\"highlights\\\" style=\\\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid rgba(122, 31, 43, .1);border-radius:18px;margin-bottom:28px;overflow:hidden;scroll-margin-top:30vh;\\\">\\n  <div style=\\\"height:5px;background:#9B1C2E;border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:20px 20px 0;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(201,146,42,0.9),rgba(217,164,65,0.8),rgba(236,200,121,0.7));backdrop-filter:blur(12px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(201,146,42,0.4),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.35);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\\\">\\n      <svg width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#ffffff\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" style=\\\"filter:drop-shadow(0 1px 3px rgba(255,255,255,0.4));\\\">\\n        <path d=\\\"M12 2L15 8l6 .9-4.5 4.3L18 20l-6-3-6 3 1.5-6.8L3 8.9 9 8z\\\"></path>\\n      </svg>\\n    </div>\\n    <h3 style=\\\"margin:0;font-size:clamp(15px,3vw,19px);font-weight:700;color:#241014;line-height:1.25;\\\">Admission Highlights 2026</h3>\\n  </div>\\n  <div style=\\\"padding:16px 20px 24px;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:0 0 16px;\\\"></div>\\n    <div style=\\\"overflow-x:auto;\\\">\\n      <table style=\\\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:360px;\\\">\\n        <thead>\\n          <tr>\\n            <th style=\\\"text-align:center;padding:14px 20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9B1C2E,#c9922a);color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;width:38%;\\\">Category</th>\\n            <th style=\\\"text-align:center;padding:14px 20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9B1C2E,#c9922a);color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;\\\">Details</th>\\n          </tr>\\n        </thead>\\n        <tbody>\\n          <tr style=\\\"border-bottom:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\" onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\'\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#ffffff\'\\\">\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:13px 20px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:#0D1B2A;border-right:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\">Program</td>\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:13px 20px;font-size:13.5px;color:#241014;\\\">Manipal University Jaipur Online admission (MUJ Online, CDOE). This is part of the Manipal online admission 2026 cycle.</td>\\n          </tr>\\n          <tr style=\\\"border-bottom:1px solid #faf8f9;background:#faf8f9;\\\" onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\'\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#faf8f9\'\\\">\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:13px 20px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:#0D1B2A;border-right:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\">Mode of Admission</td>\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:13px 20px;font-size:13.5px;color:#241014;\\\">100% Online — candidates can MUJ Online apply online end to end, reflecting the standard Manipal Online registration steps.</td>\\n          </tr>\\n          <tr style=\\\"border-bottom:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\" onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\'\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#ffffff\'\\\">\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:13px 20px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:#0D1B2A;border-right:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\">Programs Offered</td>\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:13px 20px;font-size:13.5px;color:#241014;\\\">Online BBA, BCA, B.Com, MBA, MCA, M.Com, M.Sc Mathematics, MA Economics and MA Journalism &amp; Mass Communication.</td>\\n          </tr>\\n          <tr style=\\\"border-bottom:1px solid #faf8f9;background:#faf8f9;\\\" onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\'\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#faf8f9\'\\\">\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:13px 20px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:#0D1B2A;border-right:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\">Basis of Selection</td>\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:13px 20px;font-size:13.5px;color:#241014;\\\">Eligibility-based admission, subject to meeting the program-specific MUJ Online eligibility requirements and successful document verification, in line with the university\'s Manipal Online eligibility norms.</td>\\n          </tr>\\n          <tr onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\'\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#ffffff\'\\\">\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:13px 20px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:#0D1B2A;border-right:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\">Application Mode</td>\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:13px 20px;font-size:13.5px;color:#241014;\\\">Online — submit your MUJ Online application through the Online Manipal admission portal, as part of the Manipal Online application workflow.</td>\\n          </tr>\\n        </tbody>\\n      </table>\\n    </div>\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:16px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<!-- ONLINE PROGRAMS OFFERED -->\\n<div id=\\\"programs\\\" style=\\\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid rgba(122, 31, 43, .1);border-radius:18px;margin-bottom:28px;overflow:hidden;scroll-margin-top:30vh;\\\">\\n  <div style=\\\"height:5px;background:#9B1C2E;border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:20px 20px 0;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(155,28,46,0.9),rgba(137,44,64,0.8),rgba(201,79,92,0.7));backdrop-filter:blur(12px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(137,44,64,0.4),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.35);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\\\">\\n      <svg width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#ffffff\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" style=\\\"filter:drop-shadow(0 1px 3px rgba(255,255,255,0.4));\\\">\\n        <path d=\\\"M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z\\\"></path>\\n      </svg>\\n    </div>\\n    <h3 style=\\\"margin:0;font-size:clamp(15px,3vw,19px);font-weight:700;color:#241014;line-height:1.25;\\\">Online Programs Offered</h3>\\n  </div>\\n  <div style=\\\"padding:16px 20px 24px;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:0 0 16px;\\\"></div>\\n    <p style=\\\"line-height:1.7;word-spacing:normal;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\">\\n      Students seeking <b>MUJ Online admission</b> can choose from undergraduate and postgraduate degrees. Popular choices include <b>MUJ Online BCA admission</b> and <b>MUJ Online MCA admission</b> for students interested in computer applications, and <b>MUJ Online MBA admission</b> for those pursuing a career in management. This page also introduces the Manipal university jaipur online muj admission process across all undergraduate and postgraduate programs.\\n    </p>\\n    <ul style=\\\"padding-left:18px;line-height:1.7;word-spacing:normal;padding-left:22px !important;list-style-type:disc !important;list-style-position:outside !important;margin-left:0 !important;\\\">\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\"><b>Undergraduate:</b> Online BBA, Online BCA and Online B.Com — candidates can apply through the respective Online Manipal program pages and complete the digital application process</li>\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\"><b>Postgraduate:</b> Candidates pursuing MUJ Online MBA admission, MUJ Online MCA admission, MUJ Online M.Com admission, Online M.Sc Mathematics, Online MA Economics or Online MA Journalism &amp; Mass Communication must meet the respective eligibility criteria before applying</li>\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\"><b>Other PG Options:</b> Online M.Sc Mathematics, Online M.Com, Online MA Economics and Online MA Journalism &amp; Mass Communication</li>\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\"><b>Specialized MBA:</b> MUJ\'s Online MBA is available with multiple specialization/elective options, including areas such as Finance, Marketing, Human Resource Management, International Business and other industry-focused domains; these are offered under the MUJ Online MBA program</li>\\n    </ul>\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:16px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<!-- ELIGIBILITY & SELECTION -->\\n<div id=\\\"eligibility\\\" style=\\\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid rgba(122, 31, 43, .1);border-radius:18px;margin-bottom:28px;overflow:hidden;scroll-margin-top:30vh;\\\">\\n  <div style=\\\"height:5px;background:#9B1C2E;border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:20px 20px 0;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(155,28,46,0.9),rgba(137,44,64,0.8),rgba(217,164,65,0.7));backdrop-filter:blur(12px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(137,44,64,0.4),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.35);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\\\">\\n      <svg width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#ffffff\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" style=\\\"filter:drop-shadow(0 1px 3px rgba(255,255,255,0.4));\\\">\\n        <path d=\\\"M9 11l3 3L22 4\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11\\\"></path>\\n      </svg>\\n    </div>\\n    <h3 style=\\\"margin:0;font-size:clamp(15px,3vw,19px);font-weight:700;color:#241014;line-height:1.25;\\\">MUJ Online Eligibility &amp; Selection Criteria</h3>\\n  </div>\\n  <div style=\\\"padding:16px 20px 24px;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:0 0 16px;\\\"></div>\\n    <p style=\\\"line-height:1.7;word-spacing:normal;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\">\\n      Every applicant must satisfy the <b>MUJ Online admission eligibility</b> conditions listed below before submitting an application. The <b>MUJ Online eligibility</b> requirements differ for undergraduate and postgraduate programs. These criteria form the basis of the Manipal Online eligibility framework referenced throughout this page.\\n    </p>\\n\\n    <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 10px;color:#241014;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;\\\">Undergraduate Programs — MUJ Online Eligibility</h4>\\n    <div style=\\\"overflow-x:auto;\\\">\\n      <table style=\\\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:480px;\\\">\\n        <thead>\\n          <tr>\\n            <th style=\\\"text-align:center;padding:13px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9B1C2E,#c9922a);color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.03em;text-transform:uppercase;\\\">Program</th>\\n            <th style=\\\"text-align:center;padding:13px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9B1C2E,#c9922a);color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.03em;text-transform:uppercase;\\\">Eligibility Criteria</th>\\n            <th style=\\\"text-align:center;padding:13px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9B1C2E,#c9922a);color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.03em;text-transform:uppercase;\\\">Selection Basis</th>\\n          </tr>\\n        </thead>\\n        <tbody>\\n          <tr style=\\\"border-bottom:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\" onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\'\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#ffffff\'\\\">\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:#0D1B2A;border-right:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\">Online BBA</td>\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:13.5px;color:#241014;border-right:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\">10+2 / Intermediate / Senior Secondary from a recognized board, or an equivalent qualification recognized by the Association of Indian Universities; minimum 40% aggregate marks</td>\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:13.5px;color:#241014;\\\">Eligibility-based</td>\\n          </tr>\\n          <tr style=\\\"border-bottom:1px solid #faf8f9;background:#faf8f9;\\\" onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\'\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#faf8f9\'\\\">\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:#0D1B2A;border-right:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\">Online B.Com</td>\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:13.5px;color:#241014;border-right:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\">10+2 or equivalent qualification from a recognized board/institution; candidates must satisfy the program\'s prescribed eligibility requirements</td>\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:13.5px;color:#241014;\\\">Eligibility-based</td>\\n          </tr>\\n          <tr onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\'\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#ffffff\'\\\">\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:#0D1B2A;border-right:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\">Online BCA</td>\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:13.5px;color:#241014;border-right:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\">10+2 from a recognized national or state board institution, or 10+3 diploma from a recognized national or state institute; minimum 40% aggregate marks applies under the stated Indian-student eligibility</td>\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:13.5px;color:#241014;\\\">Eligibility-based</td>\\n          </tr>\\n        </tbody>\\n      </table>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <h4 style=\\\"margin:16px 0 10px;color:#020202;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;\\\">Postgraduate Programs — MUJ Online Admission Eligibility</h4>\\n    <div style=\\\"overflow-x:auto;\\\">\\n      <table style=\\\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:480px;\\\">\\n        <thead>\\n          <tr>\\n            <th style=\\\"text-align:center;padding:13px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9B1C2E,#c9922a);color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.03em;text-transform:uppercase;\\\">Program</th>\\n            <th style=\\\"text-align:center;padding:13px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9B1C2E,#c9922a);color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.03em;text-transform:uppercase;\\\">Eligibility Criteria</th>\\n            <th style=\\\"text-align:center;padding:13px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9B1C2E,#c9922a);color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.03em;text-transform:uppercase;\\\">Selection Basis</th>\\n          </tr>\\n        </thead>\\n        <tbody>\\n          <tr style=\\\"border-bottom:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\" onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\'\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#ffffff\'\\\">\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:#0D1B2A;border-right:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\">Online MBA</td>\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:13.5px;color:#241014;border-right:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\">10+2+3-year bachelor\'s degree from a recognized university/institution or equivalent qualification; minimum 50% marks in graduation, or 45% for reserved categories</td>\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:13.5px;color:#241014;\\\">Eligibility-based</td>\\n          </tr>\\n          <tr style=\\\"border-bottom:1px solid #faf8f9;background:#faf8f9;\\\" onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\'\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#faf8f9\'\\\">\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:#0D1B2A;border-right:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\">Online MCA</td>\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:13.5px;color:#241014;border-right:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\">10+2+3-year bachelor\'s degree in Computer Applications / Computer Science / Information Technology or equivalent. Candidates from other bachelor\'s streams can also be eligible with a compulsory bridge course in computer/IT fundamentals; students without Mathematics in 10+2 or graduation must complete the compulsory Mathematics bridge course. Minimum 50% marks in graduation, or 45% for reserved categories</td>\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:13.5px;color:#241014;\\\">Eligibility-based</td>\\n          </tr>\\n          <tr onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\'\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#ffffff\'\\\">\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:#0D1B2A;border-right:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\">M.Com / MA / MAJMC</td>\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:13.5px;color:#241014;border-right:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\">Generally require a 10+2+3-year bachelor\'s degree from a recognized university/institution or equivalent qualification. For Online M.Sc Mathematics, a bachelor\'s degree with Mathematics as a compulsory subject is required</td>\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:12px 16px;font-size:13.5px;color:#241014;\\\">Eligibility-based</td>\\n          </tr>\\n        </tbody>\\n      </table>\\n    </div>\\n    <p style=\\\"line-height:1.7;word-spacing:normal;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;margin-top:16px;\\\">\\n      Applicants should also confirm the current Manipal University Jaipur registration fees before submitting documents.\\n    </p>\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:16px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<!-- STEP-BY-STEP ADMISSION PROCESS -->\\n<div id=\\\"process\\\" style=\\\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid rgba(122, 31, 43, .1);border-radius:18px;margin-bottom:28px;overflow:hidden;scroll-margin-top:30vh;\\\">\\n  <div style=\\\"height:5px;background:#9B1C2E;border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:20px 20px 0;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(155,28,46,0.9),rgba(137,44,64,0.8),rgba(201,79,92,0.7));backdrop-filter:blur(12px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(137,44,64,0.4),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.35);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\\\">\\n      <svg width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#ffffff\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" style=\\\"filter:drop-shadow(0 1px 3px rgba(255,255,255,0.4));\\\">\\n        <polyline points=\\\"9 11 12 14 22 4\\\"></polyline><path d=\\\"M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11\\\"></path>\\n      </svg>\\n    </div>\\n    <h3 style=\\\"margin:0;font-size:clamp(15px,3vw,19px);font-weight:700;color:#241014;line-height:1.25;\\\">Step-by-Step MUJ Online Admission Process</h3>\\n  </div>\\n  <div style=\\\"padding:16px 20px 24px;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:0 0 16px;\\\"></div>\\n    <p style=\\\"line-height:1.7;word-spacing:normal;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\">\\n      The <b>MUJ Online admission process</b> is designed to be simple and fully digital. Follow the steps below to complete your <b>MUJ Online application</b> without any campus visit. This sequence is also known as the Manipal university jaipur online muj admission process.\\n    </p>\\n    <ul style=\\\"padding-left:18px;line-height:1.7;word-spacing:normal;padding-left:22px !important;list-style-type:disc !important;list-style-position:outside !important;margin-left:0 !important;\\\">\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\"><b>Step 1:</b> Visit the Online Manipal admission portal and select the program you wish to pursue, then begin the MUJ Online admission process by registering with the requested contact and basic details and paying the application fee</li>\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\"><b>Step 2:</b> Fill in personal, academic and, where applicable, work-experience details, then MUJ Online apply online for your chosen undergraduate or postgraduate program</li>\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\"><b>Step 3:</b> Upload the MUJ Online documents required for identity, address, academic and applicable category/scholarship verification</li>\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\"><b>Step 4:</b> Pay the applicable admission fee for the first semester/year or full program and submit your MUJ Online application</li>\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\"><b>Step 5:</b> Wait for document verification and university evaluation of your application and MUJ Online admission eligibility</li>\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\"><b>Step 6:</b> After the university approves the submitted documents, your Manipal University Jaipur Online admission is confirmed and you can proceed with the academic onboarding process</li>\\n    </ul>\\n    <p style=\\\"line-height:1.7;word-spacing:normal;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\">\\n      This four-stage process — application, fee payment, document upload and university approval — is stated directly on MUJ program pages.\\n    </p>\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:16px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<!-- DOCUMENTS REQUIRED -->\\n<div id=\\\"documents\\\" style=\\\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid rgba(122, 31, 43, .1);border-radius:18px;margin-bottom:28px;overflow:hidden;scroll-margin-top:30vh;\\\">\\n  <div style=\\\"height:5px;background:#9B1C2E;border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:20px 20px 0;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(155,28,46,0.9),rgba(137,44,64,0.8),rgba(201,79,92,0.7));backdrop-filter:blur(12px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(137,44,64,0.4),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.35);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\\\">\\n      <svg width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#ffffff\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" style=\\\"filter:drop-shadow(0 1px 3px rgba(255,255,255,0.4));\\\">\\n        <rect x=\\\"2\\\" y=\\\"7\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"14\\\" rx=\\\"2\\\"></rect><path d=\\\"M16 7V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v2\\\"></path>\\n      </svg>\\n    </div>\\n    <h3 style=\\\"margin:0;font-size:clamp(15px,3vw,19px);font-weight:700;color:#241014;line-height:1.25;\\\">MUJ Online Documents Required</h3>\\n  </div>\\n  <div style=\\\"padding:16px 20px 24px;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:0 0 16px;\\\"></div>\\n    <p style=\\\"line-height:1.7;word-spacing:normal;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\">\\n      Candidates should keep the following <b>MUJ Online documents required</b> list ready in scanned digital format before starting their application, as incomplete uploads may delay the <b>MUJ Online admission process</b>. This checklist supports every Manipal Online application submitted during the Manipal Online admission 2026 cycle.\\n    </p>\\n    <ul style=\\\"padding-left:18px;line-height:1.7;word-spacing:normal;padding-left:22px !important;list-style-type:disc !important;list-style-position:outside !important;margin-left:0 !important;\\\">\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\">10th and 12th mark sheets and certificates</li>\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\">Graduation mark sheets for postgraduate programs including MUJ Online MBA admission and MUJ Online MCA admission</li>\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\">Graduation degree certificate for postgraduate applicants, where applicable</li>\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\">Government-issued photo ID proof — Aadhaar card is mandatory for Indian citizens; other listed proof-of-address documents can include passport and voter ID</li>\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\">Recent photograph and other application details requested by the portal</li>\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\">Category certificate, if applicable, for reserved-category benefits</li>\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\">Scholarship documents, where applicable</li>\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\">Defense Service certificate, where applicable</li>\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\">Divyaang certificate, where applicable</li>\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\">Valid CAT / GMAT / MAT score document for MBA applicants, where applicable</li>\\n      <li style=\\\"word-break:break-word;display:list-item !important;list-style-type:disc !important;\\\">Work experience certificate, where applicable; work experience is not mandatory for programs such as Online BCA and Online MA Economics</li>\\n    </ul>\\n    <p style=\\\"line-height:1.7;word-spacing:normal;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\">\\n      The official MUJ program pages distinguish between mandatory and non-mandatory documents, and the exact document list can vary according to the program and applicant category.\\n    </p>\\n    <p style=\\\"line-height:1.7;word-spacing:normal;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\">\\n      All MUJ Online documents required must be uploaded in the specified format on the admission portal; the university evaluates the submitted documents before confirming admission.\\n    </p>\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:16px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<!-- IMPORTANT DATES -->\\n<div id=\\\"dates\\\" style=\\\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid rgba(122, 31, 43, .1);border-radius:18px;margin-bottom:28px;overflow:hidden;scroll-margin-top:30vh;\\\">\\n  <div style=\\\"height:5px;background:#9B1C2E;border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:20px 20px 0;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(155,28,46,0.9),rgba(137,44,64,0.8),rgba(201,79,92,0.7));backdrop-filter:blur(12px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(137,44,64,0.4),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.35);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\\\">\\n      <svg width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#ffffff\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" style=\\\"filter:drop-shadow(0 1px 3px rgba(255,255,255,0.4));\\\">\\n        <rect x=\\\"3\\\" y=\\\"4\\\" width=\\\"18\\\" height=\\\"18\\\" rx=\\\"2\\\" ry=\\\"2\\\"></rect><line x1=\\\"16\\\" y1=\\\"2\\\" x2=\\\"16\\\" y2=\\\"6\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"8\\\" y1=\\\"2\\\" x2=\\\"8\\\" y2=\\\"6\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"3\\\" y1=\\\"10\\\" x2=\\\"21\\\" y2=\\\"10\\\"></line>\\n      </svg>\\n    </div>\\n    <h3 style=\\\"margin:0;font-size:clamp(15px,3vw,19px);font-weight:700;color:#241014;line-height:1.25;\\\">Important Dates</h3>\\n  </div>\\n  <div style=\\\"padding:16px 20px 24px;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:0 0 16px;\\\"></div>\\n    <div style=\\\"overflow-x:auto;\\\">\\n      <table style=\\\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:320px;\\\">\\n        <thead>\\n          <tr>\\n            <th style=\\\"text-align:center;padding:14px 20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9B1C2E,#c9922a);color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;width:55%;\\\">Event</th>\\n            <th style=\\\"text-align:center;padding:14px 20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9B1C2E,#c9922a);color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;\\\">Date</th>\\n          </tr>\\n        </thead>\\n        <tbody>\\n          <tr style=\\\"border-bottom:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\" onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\'\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#ffffff\'\\\">\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:13px 20px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:#0D1B2A;border-right:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\">MUJ Online Application Opens</td>\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:13px 20px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#241014;font-weight:700;padding:3px 12px;border-radius:20px;font-size:13px;\\\">2026 admissions are being conducted through the Online Manipal admission portal</span></td>\\n          </tr>\\n          <tr style=\\\"border-bottom:1px solid #faf8f9;background:#faf8f9;\\\" onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\'\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#faf8f9\'\\\">\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:13px 20px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:#0D1B2A;border-right:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\">Last Date to Apply Online</td>\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:13px 20px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#241014;font-weight:700;padding:3px 12px;border-radius:20px;font-size:13px;\\\">Program-specific. Current official Online Manipal pages list different deadlines for different MUJ programs; several pages show 12 September 2026, while the current Online B.Com page shows 15 September 2026. Confirm the exact Manipal University Jaipur Registration last date on your specific program page.</span></td>\\n          </tr>\\n          <tr style=\\\"border-bottom:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\" onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\'\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#ffffff\'\\\">\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:13px 20px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:#0D1B2A;border-right:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\">Document Verification</td>\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:13px 20px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#241014;font-weight:700;padding:3px 12px;border-radius:20px;font-size:13px;\\\">After application submission and document upload, followed by university evaluation and approval</span></td>\\n          </tr>\\n          <tr style=\\\"border-bottom:1px solid #faf8f9;background:#faf8f9;\\\" onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\'\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#faf8f9\'\\\">\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:13px 20px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:#0D1B2A;border-right:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\">Admission Confirmation</td>\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:13px 20px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#241014;font-weight:700;padding:3px 12px;border-radius:20px;font-size:13px;\\\">After successful document verification and university approval</span></td>\\n          </tr>\\n          <tr onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\'\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#ffffff\'\\\">\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:13px 20px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:#0D1B2A;border-right:1px solid #faf8f9;\\\">Academic Session Begins</td>\\n            <td style=\\\"padding:13px 20px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#241014;font-weight:700;padding:3px 12px;border-radius:20px;font-size:13px;\\\">As per the confirmed admission cycle and program schedule communicated by Online Manipal</span></td>\\n          </tr>\\n        </tbody>\\n      </table>\\n    </div>\\n    <p style=\\\"line-height:1.7;word-spacing:normal;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;margin:14px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#7a1f2b;background:#ffffffbeb;border-left:4px solid #c9922a;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;\\\">\\n      <strong>Note:</strong> MUJ Online admission dates are program-specific and can change according to the active admission cycle. Since current official course pages display different September 2026 deadlines for different programs, applicants should verify the deadline shown on their specific MUJ program page before submitting an application. Always check the latest Manipal University Jaipur Registration last date before completing payment.\\n    </p>\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:16px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<!-- FAQs -->\\n<div id=\\\"faq\\\" style=\\\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid rgba(122, 31, 43, .1);border-radius:18px;margin-bottom:28px;overflow:hidden;scroll-margin-top:30vh;\\\">\\n  <div style=\\\"height:5px;background:#9B1C2E;border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:20px 20px 0;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(201,146,42,0.9),rgba(217,164,65,0.8),rgba(236,200,121,0.7));backdrop-filter:blur(12px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(201,146,42,0.4),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.35);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\\\">\\n      <svg width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#ffffff\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" style=\\\"filter:drop-shadow(0 1px 3px rgba(255,255,255,0.4));\\\">\\n        <circle cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"12\\\" r=\\\"10\\\"></circle><path d=\\\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\\\"></path><line x1=\\\"12\\\" y1=\\\"17\\\" x2=\\\"12.01\\\" y2=\\\"17\\\"></line>\\n      </svg>\\n    </div>\\n    <h3 style=\\\"margin:0;font-size:clamp(15px,3vw,19px);font-weight:700;color:#241014;line-height:1.25;\\\">FAQs</h3>\\n  </div>\\n  <div style=\\\"padding:16px 20px 24px;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:0 0 16px;\\\"></div>\\n\\n    <!-- FAQ 1 -->\\n    <div style=\\\"border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#fdf0f2;border:1px solid #f3d9dd;border-top:4px solid #9B1C2E;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(137,44,64,0.07);margin-bottom:10px;\\\" onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#f8e8eb\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.maxHeight=\'400px\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.opacity=\'1\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.paddingBottom=\'18px\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.background=\'#9B1C2E\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.color=\'#ffffff\';\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.maxHeight=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.opacity=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.paddingBottom=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.background=\'#f3d9dd\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.color=\'#9B1C2E\';\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"padding:14px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;cursor:pointer;\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"faq-num\\\" style=\\\"flex-shrink:0;width:32px;height:32px;background:#f3d9dd;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#9B1C2E;transition:all 0.3s;\\\">1</span>\\n        <span style=\\\"font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(13px,2.5vw,15px);color:#0D1B2A;line-height:1.4;flex:1;\\\">How do I start the MUJ Online admission process?</span>\\n        <span style=\\\"flex-shrink:0;color:#f3d9dd;font-size:20px;\\\">›</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"faq-answer\\\" style=\\\"max-height:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;padding:0 20px 0 64px;font-size:13.5px;color:#241014;line-height:1.8;transition:max-height 0.4s ease,opacity 0.35s ease,padding-bottom 0.3s ease;\\\">\\n        Visit the Online Manipal admission portal, select your Manipal University Jaipur program, provide the requested basic and educational details, pay the application fee and proceed with document upload. After you submit your MUJ Online application, the university evaluates the documents and confirms admission after approval. This is the standard Manipal university jaipur online muj admission process for most programs.\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- FAQ 2 -->\\n    <div style=\\\"border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#fdf0f2;border:1px solid #f3d9dd;border-top:4px solid #9B1C2E;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(137,44,64,0.07);margin-bottom:10px;\\\" onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#f8e8eb\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.maxHeight=\'400px\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.opacity=\'1\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.paddingBottom=\'18px\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.background=\'#9B1C2E\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.color=\'#ffffff\';\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.maxHeight=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.opacity=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.paddingBottom=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.background=\'#f3d9dd\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.color=\'#9B1C2E\';\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"padding:14px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;cursor:pointer;\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"faq-num\\\" style=\\\"flex-shrink:0;width:32px;height:32px;background:#f3d9dd;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#9B1C2E;transition:all 0.3s;\\\">2</span>\\n        <span style=\\\"font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(13px,2.5vw,15px);color:#0D1B2A;line-height:1.4;flex:1;\\\">What is the MUJ Online eligibility for MBA and MCA programs?</span>\\n        <span style=\\\"flex-shrink:0;color:#f3d9dd;font-size:20px;\\\">›</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"faq-answer\\\" style=\\\"max-height:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;padding:0 20px 0 64px;font-size:13.5px;color:#241014;line-height:1.8;transition:max-height 0.4s ease,opacity 0.35s ease,padding-bottom 0.3s ease;\\\">\\n        For MUJ Online MBA admission, candidates need a recognized bachelor\'s degree and at least 50% aggregate marks in graduation, or 45% for reserved categories. For MUJ Online MCA admission, candidates generally need a 10+2+3-year bachelor\'s degree in Computer Applications, Computer Science or Information Technology; graduates from other streams may also apply subject to the required bridge courses. A minimum of 50% in graduation, or 45% for reserved categories, is prescribed. These figures form part of the current Manipal Online eligibility standards for postgraduate admission.\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- FAQ 3 -->\\n    <div style=\\\"border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#fdf0f2;border:1px solid #f3d9dd;border-top:4px solid #9B1C2E;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(137,44,64,0.07);margin-bottom:10px;\\\" onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#f8e8eb\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.maxHeight=\'400px\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.opacity=\'1\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.paddingBottom=\'18px\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.background=\'#9B1C2E\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.color=\'#ffffff\';\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.maxHeight=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.opacity=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.paddingBottom=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.background=\'#f3d9dd\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.color=\'#9B1C2E\';\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"padding:14px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;cursor:pointer;\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"faq-num\\\" style=\\\"flex-shrink:0;width:32px;height:32px;background:#f3d9dd;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#9B1C2E;transition:all 0.3s;\\\">3</span>\\n        <span style=\\\"font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(13px,2.5vw,15px);color:#0D1B2A;line-height:1.4;flex:1;\\\">What documents are needed to complete my MUJ Online application?</span>\\n        <span style=\\\"flex-shrink:0;color:#f3d9dd;font-size:20px;\\\">›</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"faq-answer\\\" style=\\\"max-height:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;padding:0 20px 0 64px;font-size:13.5px;color:#241014;line-height:1.8;transition:max-height 0.4s ease,opacity 0.35s ease,padding-bottom 0.3s ease;\\\">\\n        The MUJ Online documents required typically include proof of identity and address, Class 10 and 12 marksheets, and graduation marksheets/degree documents for PG applicants. Depending on the program and category, additional documents can include scholarship, defense-service, Divyaang, reserved-category, government-ID, work-experience or qualifying-test documents.\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- FAQ 4 -->\\n    <div style=\\\"border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#fdf0f2;border:1px solid #f3d9dd;border-top:4px solid #9B1C2E;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(137,44,64,0.07);\\\" onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background=\'#f8e8eb\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.maxHeight=\'400px\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.opacity=\'1\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.paddingBottom=\'18px\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.background=\'#9B1C2E\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.color=\'#ffffff\';\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background=\'#fdf0f2\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.maxHeight=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.opacity=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-answer\').style.paddingBottom=\'0\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.background=\'#f3d9dd\';this.querySelector(\'.faq-num\').style.color=\'#9B1C2E\';\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"padding:14px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;cursor:pointer;\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"faq-num\\\" style=\\\"flex-shrink:0;width:32px;height:32px;background:#f3d9dd;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#9B1C2E;transition:all 0.3s;\\\">4</span>\\n        <span style=\\\"font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(13px,2.5vw,15px);color:#0D1B2A;line-height:1.4;flex:1;\\\">Is Manipal University Jaipur Online admission recognized?</span>\\n        <span style=\\\"flex-shrink:0;color:#f3d9dd;font-size:20px;\\\">›</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"faq-answer\\\" style=\\\"max-height:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;padding:0 20px 0 64px;font-size:13.5px;color:#241014;line-height:1.8;transition:max-height 0.4s ease,opacity 0.35s ease,padding-bottom 0.3s ease;\\\">\\n        Yes. Manipal University is listed by the UGC Distance Education Bureau in its online-program records for Rajasthan, including Online MCA and Online BCA, with later records also listing Online MBA. MUJ\'s online programs are offered by Manipal University Jaipur through its online education setup. Applicants should verify the specific program and applicable academic-year recognition on the UGC DEB portal before enrollment. Applicants can also review the applicable Manipal University Jaipur registration fees before completing enrollment.\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:16px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\"},{\"id\":\"1789797516278\",\"title\":\"Placement & Career Support\",\"slug\":\"placement-career-support\",\"content\":\"<style>\\n  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\\n  summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\\n</style>\\n\\n<h2 style=\\\"margin-bottom:20px;color:#241014;line-height:1.3;\\\">Manipal University Jaipur Online — Placements &amp; Career Support</h2>\\n\\n<!-- INTRODUCTION -->\\n<div style=\\\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid rgba(122, 31, 43, .1);border-radius:18px;margin-bottom:28px;overflow:hidden;\\\">\\n  <div style=\\\"height:5px;background:#9B1C2E;border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:20px 20px 0;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(155,28,46,0.9),rgba(137,44,64,0.8),rgba(201,79,92,0.7));backdrop-filter:blur(12px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(137,44,64,0.4),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.35);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\\\">\\n      <svg width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#ffffff\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" style=\\\"filter:drop-shadow(0 1px 3px rgba(255,255,255,0.4));\\\"><path d=\\\"M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M2 17l10 5 10-5\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M2 12l10 5 10-5\\\"></path></svg>\\n    </div>\\n    <h3 style=\\\"margin:0;font-size:clamp(15px,3vw,19px);font-weight:700;color:#241014;line-height:1.25;\\\">Introduction</h3>\\n  </div>\\n  <div style=\\\"padding:16px 20px 24px;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:0 0 16px;\\\"></div>\\n    <p style=\\\"line-height:1.7;word-spacing:normal;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\">\\n      <b>MUJ Online placement</b> support is designed to help online learners translate their degrees into practical career opportunities. Through structured <b>MUJ Online career support</b>, students enrolled in undergraduate and postgraduate programs receive guidance on skill development, resume building, interview preparation, industry interaction, and access to recruitment opportunities — all delivered alongside their online coursework.\\n    </p>\\n    <p style=\\\"line-height:1.7;word-spacing:normal;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\">\\n      <b>Manipal University Jaipur Online placement</b> services are designed for working professionals and full-time online learners alike, with digital career support and recruitment opportunities accessible to learners across locations. From <b>MUJ Online jobs</b> in technology, analytics, finance, sales, operations and other sectors to <b>MUJ Online MBA placement</b> opportunities in management-oriented roles, the university\'s online career ecosystem connects eligible MUJ online learners with hiring opportunities and placement drives. This overview also outlines Manipal Online placements, the university\'s Manipal Online placement cell support, and typical Manipal University Jaipur placement package details for prospective students.\\n    </p>\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:16px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<!-- TABLE OF CONTENTS -->\\n<div style=\\\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid rgba(122, 31, 43, .1);border-radius:18px;margin-bottom:28px;overflow:hidden;\\\">\\n  <div style=\\\"height:5px;background:#9B1C2E;border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:20px 20px 0;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(155,28,46,0.9),rgba(137,44,64,0.8),rgba(201,79,92,0.7));border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(137,44,64,0.4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\\\">\\n      <svg width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#ffffff\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\">\\n        <line x1=\\\"8\\\" y1=\\\"6\\\" x2=\\\"21\\\" y2=\\\"6\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"8\\\" y1=\\\"12\\\" x2=\\\"21\\\" y2=\\\"12\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"8\\\" y1=\\\"18\\\" x2=\\\"21\\\" y2=\\\"18\\\"></line>\\n        <line x1=\\\"3\\\" y1=\\\"6\\\" x2=\\\"3.01\\\" y2=\\\"6\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"3\\\" y1=\\\"12\\\" x2=\\\"3.01\\\" y2=\\\"12\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"3\\\" y1=\\\"18\\\" x2=\\\"3.01\\\" y2=\\\"18\\\"></line>\\n      </svg>\\n    </div>\\n    <h3 style=\\\"margin:0;font-size:clamp(15px,3vw,19px);font-weight:700;color:#241014;\\\">Table of Contents</h3>\\n  </div>\\n  <div style=\\\"padding:16px 20px 24px;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:0 0 16px;\\\"></div>\\n    <div style=\\\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"#placement-stats\\\" style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex:1 1 260px;min-width:260px;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration:none;background:#fdf0f2;border:1px solid rgba(137, 44, 64, .14);border-left:4px solid #9B1C2E;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;color:#0D1B2A;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;\\\">\\n        <span style=\\\"background:#9B1C2E;color:#ffffff;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;\\\">1</span>\\n        Placement Highlights &amp; Career Outcomes\\n      </a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#recruiters\\\" style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex:1 1 260px;min-width:260px;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration:none;background:#fdf0f2;border:1px solid rgba(137, 44, 64, .14);border-left:4px solid #9B1C2E;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;color:#0D1B2A;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;\\\">\\n        <span style=\\\"background:#9B1C2E;color:#ffffff;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;\\\">2</span>\\n        Top Recruiting Partners\\n      </a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#services\\\" style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex:1 1 260px;min-width:260px;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration:none;background:#fdf0f2;border:1px solid rgba(137, 44, 64, .14);border-left:4px solid #9B1C2E;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;color:#0D1B2A;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;\\\">\\n        <span style=\\\"background:#9B1C2E;color:#ffffff;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;\\\">3</span>\\n        Career Acceleration Services\\n      </a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#faq\\\" style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex:1 1 260px;min-width:260px;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration:none;background:#fdf0f2;border:1px solid rgba(137, 44, 64, .14);border-left:4px solid #9B1C2E;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;color:#0D1B2A;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;\\\">\\n        <span style=\\\"background:#9B1C2E;color:#ffffff;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;\\\">4</span>\\n        FAQs\\n      </a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:16px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<!-- PLACEMENT HIGHLIGHTS -->\\n<div id=\\\"placement-stats\\\" style=\\\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid rgba(122, 31, 43, .1);border-radius:18px;margin-bottom:28px;overflow:hidden;scroll-margin-top:30vh;\\\">\\n  <div style=\\\"height:5px;background:#9B1C2E;border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:20px 20px 0;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(155,28,46,0.9),rgba(137,44,64,0.8),rgba(201,79,92,0.7));backdrop-filter:blur(12px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(137,44,64,0.4),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.35);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\\\">\\n      <svg width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#ffffff\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" style=\\\"filter:drop-shadow(0 1px 3px rgba(255,255,255,0.4));\\\"><circle cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"8\\\" r=\\\"6\\\"></circle><path d=\\\"M15.477 12.89L17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11\\\"></path></svg>\\n    </div>\\n    <h3 style=\\\"margin:0;font-size:clamp(15px,3vw,19px);font-weight:700;color:#241014;line-height:1.25;\\\">Placement Highlights &amp; Career Outcomes</h3>\\n  </div>\\n  <div style=\\\"padding:16px 20px 24px;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:0 0 16px;\\\"></div>\\n\\n    <p style=\\\"line-height:1.7;word-spacing:normal;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\">\\n      <b>MUJ Online placement support</b> connects eligible online learners with employers through a structured placement assistance ecosystem. The current placement-support figures associated with Online Manipal\'s online learner ecosystem reflect the broader network supporting learners from its online degree portfolio, including Manipal University Jaipur. This ecosystem functions as the university\'s Manipal Online placement cell, coordinating Manipal Online placements and connecting learners with a growing base of Manipal Online recruiters.\\n    </p>\\n\\n    <div style=\\\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin:0 0 16px;justify-content:center;\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"background:#fdf0f2;border:1px solid rgba(137, 44, 64, .14);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 14px;flex:1 1 80px;min-width:80px;max-width:160px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"background:#f3d9dd;border-radius:20px;padding:2px 10px;margin-bottom:4px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:clamp(11px,2.5vw,13px);font-weight:800;color:#7a1f2b;\\\">40,000+</span></div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#241014;padding-left:10px;\\\">Learners Offered Placement Assistance</div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"background:#fdf0f2;border:1px solid rgba(137, 44, 64, .14);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 14px;flex:1 1 80px;min-width:80px;max-width:160px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"background:#f3d9dd;border-radius:20px;padding:2px 10px;margin-bottom:4px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:clamp(11px,2.5vw,13px);font-weight:800;color:#7a1f2b;\\\">25,000+</span></div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#241014;padding-left:10px;\\\">Opportunities Created</div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"background:#fdf0f2;border:1px solid rgba(137, 44, 64, .14);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 14px;flex:1 1 80px;min-width:80px;max-width:160px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"background:#f3d9dd;border-radius:20px;padding:2px 10px;margin-bottom:4px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:clamp(11px,2.5vw,13px);font-weight:800;color:#7a1f2b;\\\">2,500+</span></div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#241014;padding-left:10px;\\\">Offers Received</div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"background:#fdf0f2;border:1px solid rgba(137, 44, 64, .14);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 14px;flex:1 1 80px;min-width:80px;max-width:160px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"background:#f3d9dd;border-radius:20px;padding:2px 10px;margin-bottom:4px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:clamp(11px,2.5vw,13px);font-weight:800;color:#7a1f2b;\\\">500+</span></div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#241014;padding-left:10px;\\\">Hiring Partners</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:0 0 14px;\\\"></div>\\n\\n    <p style=\\\"line-height:1.7;word-spacing:normal;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\">\\n      These figures are part of a broader <b>MUJ Online career support</b> framework that covers career preparation, skill development, employer interaction and recruitment opportunities. Programs such as <b>MUJ Online MBA placement</b> can connect eligible learners with management, finance, sales, operations, consulting and related opportunities, while BCA/MCA and other technology-oriented learners can access roles such as web developer, data analyst, business analyst, Java developer, frontend developer and AI/ML developer through applicable recruitment drives.\\n    </p>\\n\\n    <p style=\\\"line-height:1.7;word-spacing:normal;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\">\\n      In addition, MUJ online learners participate in dedicated career initiatives and recruitment events. A recent Launchpad career fair brought together <b>80+ recruiters and 4,000+ openings across 100+ roles</b> for online learners from Manipal University Jaipur, Manipal Academy of Higher Education and Sikkim Manipal University. Learners can also review indicative Manipal University Jaipur average package details shared during such events, in addition to standard Manipal Online career support resources.\\n    </p>\\n\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<!-- TOP RECRUITERS -->\\n<div id=\\\"recruiters\\\" style=\\\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid rgba(122, 31, 43, .1);border-radius:18px;margin-bottom:28px;overflow:hidden;scroll-margin-top:30vh;\\\">\\n  <div style=\\\"height:5px;background:#9B1C2E;border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;\\\"></div>\\n  <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:20px 20px 0;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(155,28,46,0.9),rgba(137,44,64,0.8),rgba(201,79,92,0.7));backdrop-filter:blur(12px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(137,44,64,0.4),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.35);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\\\">\\n      <svg width=\\\"22\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#ffffff\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" style=\\\"filter:drop-shadow(0 1px 3px rgba(255,255,255,0.4));\\\"><rect x=\\\"2\\\" y=\\\"4\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" rx=\\\"2\\\"></rect><line x1=\\\"8\\\" y1=\\\"2\\\" x2=\\\"8\\\" y2=\\\"22\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"16\\\" y1=\\\"2\\\" x2=\\\"16\\\" y2=\\\"22\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"2\\\" y1=\\\"9\\\" x2=\\\"22\\\" y2=\\\"9\\\"></line><line x1=\\\"2\\\" y1=\\\"15\\\" x2=\\\"22\\\" y2=\\\"15\\\"></line></svg>\\n    </div>\\n    <h3 style=\\\"margin:0;font-size:clamp(15px,3vw,19px);font-weight:700;color:#241014;line-height:1.25;\\\">Top Recruiting Partners</h3>\\n  </div>\\n  <div style=\\\"padding:16px 20px 24px;\\\">\\n    <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:0 0 16px;\\\"></div>\\n\\n    <p style=\\\"line-height:1.7;word-spacing:normal;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\\\">\\n      The corporate network built through <b>MUJ Online placement</b> outreach spans technology, financial services, consulting, healthcare, e-commerce, education, telecom and other sectors. Recruiters featured across the broader online career ecosystem include the following. These recruiter connections are maintained by the university\'s Manipal Online placement cell and represent the broader network of Manipal Online recruiters partnering with the program.\\n    </p>\\n\\n    <!-- Top Recruiting Partners -->\\n<div style=\\\"padding:clamp(15px,3vw,20px);font-size:clamp(14px,2vw,16px);line-height:1.7;\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"height:1px;background:#9B1C2E;opacity:0.15;margin:0 0 16px;\\\"></div>\\n\\n      <!-- IT & Technology -->\\n      <p style=\\\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9B1C2E;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin:0 0 10px;text-transform:uppercase;border-bottom:2px solid rgba(137,44,64,0.2);padding-bottom:4px;\\\">IT &amp; Technology</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-bottom:20px;\\\">\\n\\n        <!-- TCS -->\\n        <div style=\\\"width:110px;height:100px;border-radius:12px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #f3d9dd;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;cursor:default;transition:all 0.25s ease;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(137,44,64,0.08);\\\" onmouseover=\\\"this.style.transform=\'translateY(-6px) scale(1.05)\';this.style.b