raduate and postgraduate programs for students and working professionals. DBU ODL is approved by the UGC-DEB and the university is accredited with an NAAC A+ grade. The programs are designed to provide quality education through self-learning materials, online academic support, and a learner-friendly approach, enabling students to study anytime and from anywhere.','university','distance','{\"location\":\"Punjab\",\"established\":\"2012\",\"naac_grade\":\"A+\",\"meta_title\":\"\",\"meta_description\":\"\",\"programs\":[],\"placement\":{\"highest_package\":\"\",\"average_package\":\"\",\"placement_rate\":\"\"},\"tabs\":[],\"approvals\":[],\"affiliations\":[],\"rankings\":[]}','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(24,'IIMT University','iimt-university',1,'/uploads/clients/1784027606834-logo-1783536858828-859501428.png',1,'IIMT University Open & Distance Learning (ODL) is the distance education division of IIMT University, Meerut, offering flexible undergraduate and postgraduate programs for students, working professionals, and lifelong learners. The university focuses on accessible, career-oriented education through self-learning materials, digital learning resources, and academic support, enabling learners to study at their own pace while meeting UGC-DEB regulations for approved ODL programs.','university','distance','{\"location\":\"Uttar Pradesh\",\"established\":\"2016\",\"naac_grade\":\"A+\",\"meta_title\":\"\",\"meta_description\":\"\",\"programs\":[],\"placement\":{\"highest_package\":\"\",\"average_package\":\"\",\"placement_rate\":\"\"},\"tabs\":[],\"approvals\":[],\"affiliations\":[],\"rankings\":[]}','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(25,'Andhra University','andhra-university',1,'/uploads/clients/1784028198879-images.jpg',1,'Andhra University is one of India\'s oldest public universities, established in 1926 in Visakhapatnam, Andhra Pradesh. It is a renowned residential and affiliating university offering undergraduate, postgraduate, doctoral, and professional programs across disciplines such as Arts, Science, Engineering, Commerce, Management, Law, Pharmacy, and Education. The university is recognized for its strong focus on teaching, research, innovation, and academic excellence','university','online','{\"location\":\"ANDHRA\",\"established\":\"1926\",\"naac_grade\":\"A+\",\"meta_title\":\"\",\"meta_description\":\"\",\"programs\":[],\"placement\":{\"highest_package\":\"\",\"average_package\":\"\",\"placement_rate\":\"\"},\"tabs\":[],\"approvals\":[],\"affiliations\":[],\"rankings\":[]}','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(26,'Desh Bhagat University (DBU Online)','desh-bhagat-university-dbu-online',1,'/uploads/clients/1787996920680-447702134_1001539307987014_2826087184366270743_n.jpg',1,'Desh Bhagat University (DBU Online) is the online education division of Desh Bhagat University, offering UGC-entitled undergraduate and postgraduate degree programs through a flexible digital learning platform. Accredited with an NAAC A+ grade, DBU Online provides industry-relevant curricula, expert faculty, and learner support to help students balance higher education with personal and professional commitments.','university','online','{\"location\":\"Punjab\",\"established\":\"2012\",\"naac_grade\":\"A+\",\"meta_title\":\"\",\"meta_description\":\"\",\"programs\":[],\"placement\":{\"highest_package\":\"\",\"average_package\":\"\",\"placement_rate\":\"\"},\"tabs\":[],\"approvals\":[],\"affiliations\":[],\"rankings\":[]}','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(27,'DPU NAVI MUMBAI','dpu-navi-mumbai',1,'/uploads/clients/1784028619800-images.png',1,'DPU (D. Y. Patil University), Navi Mumbai is a leading private deemed-to-be university in Maharashtra, known for its multidisciplinary education, research-driven approach, and modern infrastructure. The university offers undergraduate, postgraduate, doctoral, and online programs across fields such as Engineering, Management, Health Sciences, Design, Biotechnology, and Liberal Arts, with a strong focus on innovation, industry exposure, and holistic student development.','university','online','{\"location\":\"Mumbai\",\"established\":\"2002\",\"naac_grade\":\"A+\",\"meta_title\":\"\",\"meta_description\":\"\",\"programs\":[],\"placement\":{\"highest_package\":\"\",\"average_package\":\"\",\"placement_rate\":\"\"},\"tabs\":[],\"approvals\":[],\"affiliations\":[],\"rankings\":[]}','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(28,'Galgotias University','galgotias-university',1,'/uploads/clients/1784028778579-download.png',1,'Galgotias University is a leading private university located in Greater Noida, Uttar Pradesh, known for its multidisciplinary education, industry-oriented curriculum, and strong emphasis on research, innovation, and employability. Accredited with a NAAC A+ grade, the university offers undergraduate, postgraduate, and doctoral programs across Engineering, Management, Law, Pharmacy, Medical Sciences, Computer Applications, and other disciplines, supported by modern infrastructure and industry collaborations.','university','online','{\"location\":\"Noida\",\"established\":\"2012\",\"naac_grade\":\"A+\",\"meta_title\":\"\",\"meta_description\":\"\",\"programs\":[],\"placement\":{\"highest_package\":\"\",\"average_package\":\"\",\"placement_rate\":\"\"},\"tabs\":[],\"approvals\":[],\"affiliations\":[],\"rankings\":[]}','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
