margin:0 16px;\"></div>\r\n        <div class=\"faq-ans\" style=\"max-height:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;padding:0 16px 0 62px;font-size:13px;color:#5a3a3a;line-height:1.75;transition:all 0.4s;\">Simply contact our team through GeduConnect to begin your admission process or explore partnership opportunities for Online, Distance, and Regular Degree admissions.</div>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Footer CTA -->\r\n    <div style=\"margin-top:44px;text-align:center;\">\r\n      <div style=\"height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,rgba(122,31,43,0.2),transparent);width:100%;margin-bottom:20px;\"></div>\r\n      <p style=\"color:rgba(20,7,11,0.4);font-size:14px;margin:0 0 16px;\">Still have questions? Our team is ready to help.</p>\r\n      <div class=\"gec-faq-footer\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\r\n        <a href=\"#contact\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7a1f2b,#9a2535);border:1px solid rgba(201,146,42,0.3);color:#fff;padding:12px 28px;border-radius:12px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">Contact Us ›</a>\r\n        <a href=\"#partner\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:rgba(201,146,42,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(201,146,42,0.3);color:#c9922a;padding:12px 28px;border-radius:12px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\">Become a Partner ›</a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════\r\n     CTA BANNER\r\n═══════════════════════════════════════ -->\r\n<section style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7a1f2b 0%,#1a0a10 100%);padding:72px 20px;font-family:\'Inter\',sans-serif;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-top:3px solid #c9922a;\">\r\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;width:400px;height:400px;top:50%;left:50%;margin:-200px 0 0 -200px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(201,146,42,0.1) 0%,transparent 70%);pointer-events:none;\"></div>\r\n  <div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;\">\r\n    <span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#c9922a;letter-spacing:0.28em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:14px;\">Join GeduConnect</span>\r\n    <h2 style=\"font-family:\'Cormorant Garamond\',Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,50px);font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 18px;\">Get Started Today</h2>\r\n    <div style=\"width:64px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#c9922a,#f5d996);margin:0 auto 20px;border-radius:2px;\"></div>\r\n    <p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);margin:0 auto 32px;max-width:560px;\">Join GeduConnect and experience professional End-to-End Admission Support for Online, Distance, and Regular Degree admissions. Contact our team today to streamline your admission process and grow with trusted university partnerships.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"gec-cta-btns\" style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\r\n      <a href=\"#contact\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c9922a,#a0721e);color:#fff;font-family:\'Inter\',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;padding:15px 40px;border-radius:50px;box-shadow:0 10px 40px rgba(201,146,42,0.4);\">Contact Our Team</a>\r\n      <a href=\"#services\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:transparent;color:#c9922a;font-family:\'Inter\',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;padding:15px 40px;border-radius:50px;border:2px solid rgba(201,146,42,0.5);\">Explore Services</a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>',NULL,'End-to-End Admission','Who Can Benefit?\r\n\r\nOur End-to-End Admission Support services are ideal for:\r\n\r\nEducation Consultants\r\nCoaching Institutes\r\nFreelance Counselors\r\nCareer Advisors\r\nTraining Centers\r\nStudy Centers\r\nAdmission Partners\r\nStudents Seeking University Admissions\r\nBenefits of Partnering with GeduConnect\r\nTrusted University Admission Support\r\nDedicated Backend Assistance\r\nEasy Enrollment Process\r\nFaster Admission Coordination\r\nExpert Documentation Support\r\nMarketing & Counseling Assistance\r\nNationwide Admission Opportunities\r\nLong-Term Partnership Support\r\nSimplify University Admissions with Expert Support\r\n\r\nThe higher education industry is evolving rapidly, and students require trusted guidance to make the right academic decisions. With GeduConnect’s End-to-End Admission Support services, you can simplify the admission journey while ensuring students receive professional assistance at every step.\r\n\r\nHelp students secure admissions confidently while building a reliable and scalable education support network.\r\n\r\nGet Started Today\r\n\r\nJoin GeduConnect and experience professional End-to-End Admission Support for Online, Distance, and Regular Degree admissions.\r\n\r\nContact our team today to streamline your admission process and grow with trusted university partnerships.','Complete University Admission Solutions for Students & Consultants'),(3,'Publishing & Printing','Welcome to our Publications Hub, where we bring you insightful and impactful content designed to inform, inspire, and innovate. Our diverse range of publications spans [list the areas/topics], reflecting our commitment to excellence and thought leadership.','/uploads/services/1771440087006-495151416.webp','/uploads/services/1779292653334-868832095.png',3,1,'2026-02-11 11:04:25','2026-05-30 08:42:03','publishing-printing',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<!-- GeduConnect | Publishing & Printing Services | Mobile-Responsive | CKEditor Safe -->\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\r\n  .gec-grid-3   { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; }\r\n  .gec-grid-4   { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr !important; gap: 14px !important; }\r\n  .gec-grid-2   { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; gap: 32px !important; }\r\n  .gec-grid-2x2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr !important; gap: 12px !important; }\r\n  .gec-faq-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; }\r\n  .gec-sec-pad  { padding: 52px 16px !important; }\r\n  .gec-sec-dark { padding: 52px 16px !important; }\r\n  .gec-hero-pad { padding: 48px 16px 36px !important; }\r\n  .gec-who-card { padding: 28px 20px !important; }\r\n  .gec-who-badge { display: none !important; }\r\n  .gec-cta-btns { flex-direction: column !important; align-items: center !important; }\r\n  .gec-cta-btns a { width: 100% !important; max-width: 320px !important; text-align: center !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding-left: 16px !important; padding-right: 16px !important; }\r\n}\r\n@media (max-width: 480px) {\r\n  .gec-grid-4   { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; }\r\n  .gec-grid-2x2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr !important; }\r\n  .gec-who-tags { gap: 8px !important; }\r\n}\r\n</style>\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════\r\n     INTRO / HERO\r\n═══════════════════════════════════════ -->\r\n<section class=\"gec-hero-pad\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(180deg,#faf8f5 0%,#f3ede0 100%);padding:70px 20px 50px;font-family:\'Inter\',sans-serif;border-top:1px solid rgba(122,31,43,0.1);\">\r\n  <div style=\"max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;\">\r\n    <span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#c9922a;letter-spacing:0.28em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:14px;\">GeduConnect</span>\r\n    <h1 style=\"font-family:\'Cormorant Garamond\',Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(26px,3.5vw,46px);font-weight:700;color:#14070b;line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 14px;\">Publishing &amp; Printing Services</h1>\r\n    <div style=\"width:64px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#7a1f2b,#c9922a);margin:0 auto 24px;border-radius:2px;\"></div>\r\n    <p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#4a4a4a;margin:0 auto;max-width:780px;\">At GeduConnect, we offer professional Publishing &amp; Printing Services for educational institutions, coaching centers, consultants, and businesses across India. We provide high-quality printing solutions for brochures, prospectuses, certificates, admission kits, banners, academic publications, and promotional materials.</p>\r\n    <p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#6b7280;margin:16px auto 0;max-width:740px;\">With a focus on quality, precision, and timely delivery, we help organizations create impactful educational and marketing materials that build trust and engagement.</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════\r\n     WHY CHOOSE US\r\n═══════════════════════════════════════ -->\r\n<section class=\"gec-sec-pad\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f3ede0 0%,#faf8f5 100%);padding:72px 20px;font-family:\'Inter\',sans-serif;\">\r\n  <div style=\"text-align:center;max-width:700px;margin:0 auto 48px;\">\r\n    <span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#c9922a;letter-spacing:0.28em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:14px;\">Why Choose Us</span>\r\n    <h2 style=\"font-family:\'Cormorant Garamond\',Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(26px,3.5vw,44px);font-weight:700;color:#14070b;line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 14px;\">Why Choose Our Publishing &amp; Printing Services?</h2>\r\n    <div style=\"width:64px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#7a1f2b,#c9922a);margin:0 auto 18px;border-radius:2px;\"></div>\r\n    <p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#6b7280;margin:0;\">Professional, customized, and high-quality publishing solutions tailored for institutions and businesses across India.</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"gec-grid-3\" style=\"max-width:1140px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;\">\r\n\r\n    <div style=\"background:#ffffff;border-radius:18px;padding:28px 22px 24px;border:1px solid rgba(122,31,43,0.08);box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);position:relative;overflow:hidden;\">\r\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:4px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#7a1f2b,#c9922a);\"></div>\r\n      <div style=\"width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(122,31,43,0.1),rgba(201,146,42,0.16));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:18px;font-size:26px;\">🖨️</div>\r\n      <h3 style=\"font-family:\'Cormorant Garamond\',Georgia,serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#14070b;margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.25;\">High-Quality Printing Solutions</h3>\r\n      <p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:#6b7280;margin:0;\">Get premium-quality printing services with professional finishing, vibrant designs, and durable materials.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div style=\"background:#ffffff;border-radius:18px;padding:28px 22px 24px;border:1px solid rgba(122,31,43,0.08);box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);position:relative;overflow:hidden;\">\r\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:4px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#7a1f2b,#c9922a);\"></div>\r\n      <div style=\"width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(122,31,43,0.1),rgba(201,146,42,0.16));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:18px;font-size:26px;\">🎨</div>\r\n      <h3 style=\"font-family:\'Cormorant Garamond\',Georgia,serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#14070b;margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.25;\">Customized Design &amp; Branding Support</h3>\r\n      <p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:#6b7280;margin:0;\">Create brochures, prospectuses, banners, flyers, and promotional materials that reflect your institution\'s identity.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div style=\"background:#ffffff;border-radius:18px;padding:28px 22px 24px;border:1px solid rgba(122,31,43,0.08);box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);position:relative;overflow:hidden;\">\r\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:4px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#7a1f2b,#c9922a);\"></div>\r\n      <div style=\"width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(122,31,43,0.1),rgba(201,146,42,0.16));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:18px;font-size:26px;\">📚</div>\r\n      <h3 style=\"font-family:\'Cormorant Garamond\',Georgia,serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#14070b;margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.25;\">Complete Publishing Assistance</h3>\r\n      <p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:#6b7280;margin:0;\">From content layout and design to printing and final delivery, we manage the entire publishing process efficiently.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════\r\n     WHO CAN BENEFIT\r\n═══════════════════════════════════════ -->\r\n<section class=\"gec-sec-pad\" style=\"background:#faf8f5;padding:72px 20px;font-family:\'Inter\',sans-serif;\">\r\n  <div style=\"max-width:1140px;margin:0 auto;\">\r\n    <div class=\"gec-grid-2\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:56px;align-items:center;\">\r\n\r\n      <div style=\"position:relative;\">\r\n        <div class=\"gec-who-card\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a0a10 0%,#3a0f1c 100%);border-radius:20px;padding:40px 32px;box-shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(122,31,43,0.25);border:1px solid rgba(201,146,42,0.15);\">\r\n          <div style=\"font-family:\'Cormorant Garamond\',Georgia,serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#c9922a;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:22px;\">Ideal For</div>\r\n          <div class=\"gec-who-tags\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;\">\r\n            <span style=\"display:inline-block;backgrou